      "id": "COMMON_MESSAGE_763",
      "message_ID": 763,
      "file_path": "/COMMON/MESFILE.DK4",
      "speaker": "Trader",
      "english": "You're going to invest? I knew you weren't like the others! How much will you put in?",
      "clean_Japanese": "投資してくれるってのかい？\nさすが、他の連中とはどこか違うと\n思ってたよ\nで、いくら投資してもらえるんだ？",
      "source_meaning": "The trader is surprised that Rafael will invest, says he seemed different from the others, and asks how much.",
      "context": "After investing in Lisbon, Rafael tries to buy two units of Salt for more than he has. The trader refuses, dismissing the warning restores the pending deal, and Back clears it.",
      "localization_note": "The quick turn from surprise to flattery to a price question sounds like the same trader trying to close the deal.",
      "decision": "retention",
